    "sections": {
        "description": "The Prompt Marketplace Theme provides a structured framework for presenting AI prompt collections with a clean and organized layout. It includes responsive pages, customizable sections, category management, featured listings, and search support to improve content navigation. The theme offers flexible styling options for colors, fonts, headers, footers, and page layouts through built-in customization settings. It also supports widget-ready areas, optimized code structure, and compatibility with widely used plugins to extend functionality when needed. The layout is designed to present prompt listings, descriptions, and supporting information in a clear format without unnecessary complexity. Navigation menus, content grids, and organized sections help visitors locate prompts more efficiently. The responsive design adapts to different screen sizes, ensuring consistent usability across desktops, tablets, and smartphones. With straightforward customization and a practical content structure, the theme provides a reliable foundation for publishing and managing AI prompt marketplace content."
    },
